Prompt A: 	
	Create a painting that uses watercolors to create a composition of a grand castle by a water body with a black starry night behind it. There should be straight lines for the towers and the diagonal lines and irregular shapes for the windows with few flags on top of the towers. The flags should be waving from the wind to indicate movement and there should be a contrast between the dark night sky and the castle glowing from the windows of the many rooms. The background there should be a wet-on-wet transition gradient, and it should also have bleeding edges to make the background look vast. There should be watery layering in the castle to emphasize the shadows from the lights and to show the structure design of it. 

